# EmailJS Configuration
# Get these credentials from: https://www.emailjs.com
# Required for suggestion, rating, and waitlist email submissions to work
VITE_FEEDBACK_EMAIL=your-email@example.com
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key

# IMPORTANT: In local development, copy this file to .env.local and fill in your credentials
# .env.local is git-ignored and will not be committed.
#
# For Netlify/Production deployment:
# 1. Go to your Netlify site dashboard
# 2. Site Settings > Build & Deploy > Environment
# 3. Add these 4 environment variables with your EmailJS credentials
# 4. Redeploy the site for changes to take effect